---
layout: base.njk
title: "Squat Strength Calculator | Predict Your Vertical Jump & Sprint Speed"
description: "Find out what your squat strength predicts for your vertical jump and sprint speed. Based on sports science research. Free instant calculator for athletes."
canonicalPath: "/squat-strength-calculator"
mailerlite: true
pageStyle: |-
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  
    :root {
      --bg: #080c10;
      --surface: #0f1419;
      --surface2: #161c24;
      --border: #1e2832;
      --accent: #aaff00;
      --accent-dim: rgba(170,255,0,0.12);
      --accent-glow: rgba(170,255,0,0.35);
      --accent2: #ff6b00;
      --accent2-dim: rgba(255,107,0,0.12);
      --text: #e8edf2;
      --text-muted: #5a6470;
      --text-mid: #8a96a4;
      --red: #ff4d4d;
      --orange: #ff9000;
      --yellow: #ffd600;
      --green: #aaff00;
      --blue: #00cfff;
      --font-display: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
      --font-body: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      --font-mono: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    }
  
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  
    body {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      min-height: 100vh;
      line-height: 1.5;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }
  
    header {
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
  
    .eyebrow {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
  
    h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 8vw, 5.5rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 0.95;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text);
    }
  
    h1 span { color: var(--accent); display: block; }
  
    .subtitle {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--text-mid);
      margin-top: 1rem;
      max-width: 520px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }
  
    .container {
      max-width: 780px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 4rem;
    }
  
    .site-link {
      display: block;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      color: var(--text-mid);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
    }
  
    .site-link:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
    .site-link strong { color: var(--accent); }
  
    .links-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
  
    @media (max-width: 500px) { .links-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  
    .card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
  
    .card-label {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
  
    .form-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
  
    @media (max-width: 520px) { .form-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  
    .field label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--text-mid);
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }
  
    .field select,
    .field input {
      width: 100%;
      background: var(--surface2);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 1rem;
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      appearance: none;
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }
  
    .field select:focus,
    .field input:focus {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--accent-dim);
    }
  
    .full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  
    /* unit toggle for weight/height */
    .input-with-unit { position: relative; }
  
    .unit-toggle {
      display: flex;
      background: var(--surface2);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      overflow: hidden;
      height: 48px;
    }
  
    .unit-btn {
      flex: 1;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: none;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      transition: all 0.15s;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
    }
  
    .unit-btn.active { background: var(--accent); color: #000; }
  
    .calc-btn {
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 1.25rem;
      padding: 1rem;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #000;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: opacity 0.15s, transform 0.1s;
    }
  
    .calc-btn:hover { opacity: 0.88; }
    .calc-btn:active { transform: scale(0.98); }
  
    /* ── RATIO DISPLAY ── */
    .ratio-pill {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 1.25rem;
      background: var(--surface2);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
  
    .ratio-val {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 3rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--accent);
      line-height: 1;
      transition: color 0.5s;
    }
  
    .ratio-label {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.62rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-top: 0.3rem;
    }
  
    .ratio-desc {
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--text-mid);
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }
  
    /* ── RESULTS ── */
    #results { display: none; }
    #results.visible { display: block; }
  
    /* ── DUAL RESULT CARDS ── */
    .dual-results {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
  
    @media (max-width: 500px) { .dual-results { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  
    .result-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
  
    .result-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -50px; left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: 200px; height: 200px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
  
    .result-card.vert::before { background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--accent-dim) 0%, transparent 70%); }
    .result-card.sprint::before { background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--accent2-dim) 0%, transparent 70%); }
  
    .result-card-eyebrow {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
  
    .result-main {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 4rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
    }
  
    .result-unit {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
  
    .result-range {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text-mid);
      background: var(--surface2);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
    }
  
    /* ── GAUGE (ratio meter) ── */
    .gauge-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 2rem 2rem 2.5rem;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
  
    .gauge-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -60px; left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: 320px; height: 320px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--accent-dim) 0%, transparent 70%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
  
    .gauge-card-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      color: var(--text-mid);
    }
  
    .gauge-svg {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      overflow: visible;
    }
  
    .gauge-track { fill: none; stroke: var(--surface2); stroke-width: 18; stroke-linecap: round; }
  
    .gauge-fill {
      fill: none;
      stroke-width: 18;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      transition: stroke-dashoffset 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), stroke 0.6s ease;
    }
  
    .verdict {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 5vw, 2.4rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }
  
    .verdict-sub { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-mid); }
  
    /* ── STRENGTH SCALE ── */
    .scale-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
  
    .scale-card-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
  
    .scale-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    }
  
    .scale-label { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-mid); width: 120px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  
    .scale-track {
      flex: 1;
      height: 8px;
      background: var(--surface2);
      border-radius: 100px;
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }
  
    .scale-fill {
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: 100px;
      transition: width 1s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }
  
    .scale-you-marker {
      position: absolute;
      top: -3px;
      width: 14px; height: 14px;
      background: var(--accent);
      border-radius: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--accent-glow);
      transition: left 1s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }
  
    .scale-val { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-mid); width: 52px; text-align: right; flex-shrink: 0; }
  
    .scale-strip {
      display: flex;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      height: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
  
    .scale-strip div { flex: 1; }
  
    .scale-labels {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
  
    /* ── INFO CARD ── */
    .info-card {
      background: var(--accent-dim);
      border: 1px solid rgba(170,255,0,0.2);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
  
    .info-icon { font-size: 1.2rem; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 0.1rem; }
    .info-text { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-mid); line-height: 1.6; }
    .info-text strong { color: var(--accent); }
  
    /* ── NEXT STEPS CARD ── */
    .next-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
  
    .next-card-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      color: var(--accent);
    }
  
    .next-item {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      padding-bottom: 1rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
  
    .next-item:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; padding-bottom: 0; border-bottom: none; }
  
    .next-num {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--accent);
      line-height: 1;
      width: 28px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      opacity: 0.4;
    }
  
    .next-text { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-mid); line-height: 1.6; }
    .next-text strong { color: var(--text); }
  
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
  
    footer a { color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; }
    footer a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
  
    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px); }
      to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
  
    .anim { animation: fadeUp 0.5s ease both; }
    .anim-d1 { animation-delay: 0.05s; }
    .anim-d2 { animation-delay: 0.15s; }
    .anim-d3 { animation-delay: 0.25s; }
    .anim-d4 { animation-delay: 0.35s; }
    .anim-d5 { animation-delay: 0.45s; }
  
    .you-row .scale-fill { background: var(--accent); }
    .you-row .scale-label { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
  </style>
disclaimer:
  - "Predictions based on published sports science research correlating relative squat strength with jump height and sprint speed."
  - "Results are estimates. Individual variation in technique, muscle fiber composition, and plyometric ability will affect actual performance."
